{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_3cc4dcce2d29","title":"取证杂谈","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ==&mid=2247484147&idx=1&sn=49bb2ce53e9f7ee1d94a4f58361ecbf2&chksm=eaf1035345ae709cc5bf61a1bed999d10c28f9f5ef5573ad14bfa8c7f4993d80cff4e673ee20&scene=126&sessionid=1795732197#rd","description":"分享电子取证及司法鉴定相关知识","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"取证杂谈","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM5n5cNJmibBN9xSsZfISNmU0jD021QDphpiaVjdAiazzibVZA%2F0","updated":"2026-05-27T09:50:00.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ%3D%3D:2247484147:1","title":"记一次IMEI校验的意外","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ==&mid=2247484147&idx=1&sn=49bb2ce53e9f7ee1d94a4f58361ecbf2&chksm=eaf1035345ae709cc5bf61a1bed999d10c28f9f5ef5573ad14bfa8c7f4993d80cff4e673ee20&scene=126&sessionid=1795732197#rd","description":"IMEI号通常应通过Luhn校验，但笔者在用大模型辅助校对电子数据文书时，意外发现一部正规品牌手机的IMEI号无法通过校验。经反复核对，手机端记录无误，校验失败原因未知。此事表明，并非所有IMEI号都严格遵循Luhn算法，实践中可能存在例外，值得从业者留意。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FcVfk4uaEK6ArkOFBlTB3e4VC0slK6PqPx2PmvibIiaJ4UNDRIJIcT6c34gqVp0iaX0jCw9cdatRVSjKiblhUWXV6iaBibWvwy5p2L4sERc2WerCbo%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-05-27T09:50:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ%3D%3D:2247484143:1","title":"X-Ways Forensics 21.0预览版发布","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ==&mid=2247484143&idx=1&sn=8c1d201e8e602959caee208c12df0bdc&chksm=ea9aea9bec3ef9526b7d100ca9917ab19293603ad9a4d87c8cff5355d252e1cc5da00e868265&scene=126&sessionid=1795732197#rd","description":"X-Ways Forensics 21.0预览版今天已发布，快来看看更新了哪些内容。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FXzPGfNichNcxylicq8cM5fA8iaabbNicN9LzCts8IKkdJo75vt9eBrBTXKDP8BiaLACQBu3N2brgK5eZPrDTicAZ0GSQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2023-09-05T12:43:11.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ%3D%3D:2247484127:1","title":"在前几天发布的20.9 Beta版中，X-Ways添加了一项个人认为比较重要的功能——E01镜像的现代压缩功能。启用此选项后，X-Ways制作的镜像将使用新的压缩算法对原始数据进行压缩，镜像速度更快，得到的镜像文件更小，后续的数据随机读取速度更快。经过测试，启用此选项得到的E01镜像体积确实要小于之前的版本X-Ways制作的镜像。新的镜像格式只有20.9及后续版本的X-Ways才能识别，且EnCase、FTK等其他软件暂时也无法识别。如果制作镜像后续不需要与他人进行交换，X-Ways Forensics新E01格式将是一个不错的选择。","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ==&mid=2247484127&idx=1&sn=915f66a836240be4bdfb1bbebf63c01c&chksm=ea3e4a3e661d4a9c4a2b0f7d8e203e16100eec6ad8e300454fb4ef0e3d9f03189724880e7527&scene=126&sessionid=1795732197#rd","description":"","type":"article","published":"2023-06-16T08:56:02.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ%3D%3D:2247484125:1","title":"电子数据取证时间问题之filetime时间戳手工解析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ==&mid=2247484125&idx=1&sn=831c89a179787612211bf94bf3060706&chksm=eaa2b3bbaa02ad09f738e04e127d6626dff1a559e39a81364f72f1f126710e5256fc524edffc&scene=126&sessionid=1795732197#rd","description":"filetime时间戳是Windows中使用最广泛的时间格式，回收站中记录的文件删除时间，快捷方式文件中记录的文档打开时间，都是这种格式。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FXzPGfNichNcwJjXoGoUD9fiaXNjxOSPNXmlllsUJMKFiciaezBtFdjLe0T71VFLs2wEH7Cu04xucArvgMrX6MgkYrg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2023-04-30T00:43:12.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ%3D%3D:2247484114:1","title":"电子数据取证时间问题之时间是怎么存储的？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ==&mid=2247484114&idx=1&sn=5bd1a67159344b8a04d2cb7c82233288&chksm=ea54b95161c2d2ecd4ba808f02f8692585979a6e0e50964c9d3ed24e1d6204812ce8f7490ea2&scene=126&sessionid=1795732197#rd","description":"取证要解决的无非是弄清楚什么人在什么时间在什么地方做了什么事，也就是4W（Who，When，Where，What）问题。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FXzPGfNichNcws9yzzsTGc3dnzpj1APtAfbJF6uTWibsiaTkOew7xTctyym