nqDMI7VGIXbxPCjjYmnSF3tDkiaiagXrUyBcyg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2021-07-05T16:33:58.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ%3D%3D:2247484035:1","title":"Windows11要求硬件必须有TPM2.0，以后Windows很可能也会和Android、iOS、macOS一样全盘加密。对普通用户来说，系统更安全了，对取证工作者来说，却喜忧参半。","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ==&mid=2247484035&idx=1&sn=8c23593a8fa9b17b3fa13bdc7bab076e&chksm=eb2ca219dc5b2b0fe7af3a53ccb532ac416a5a758d0652665dd2fb96c79df1f7512a475009ef&scene=126&sessionid=1795732197#rd","description":"","type":"article","published":"2021-06-25T01:20:03.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ%3D%3D:2247484016:1","title":"第六届美亚杯\n\n第六届美亚杯全国电子数据取证竞赛今天在线上举行，我和同事也报名参加了。大家最近事情比较多，比赛前一天还都在各自岗位工作，一直到昨天晚上队员们才一起碰头准备机器讨论比赛分工。题量有点大，有限的时间下，分析接近1TB的数据，压力还是挺大的。通过这次比赛，意识到了自己不少的知识薄弱点。","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Mjc0MjkwMQ==&mid=2247484016&idx=1&sn=1ed68d7dda7522c06dc84061432013aa&chksm=eb2ca2eadc5b2bfc752b9a257553c3c48ec472c26006a2d677b69832bf32d98293d8c6a6a79e&scene=126&sessionid=1795732197#rd","description":"","type":"article","published":"2020-11-14T14:48:18.000Z"}]}